# Dampf: one steam puff from the Schafbergbahn's funnel (renderer particle,
# D-067). A soft cloud w with h undersides, lit top left: frame 0 a small
# fresh puff at the bottom, frame 1 grown, frame 2 thinned out into two
# wisps, mostly h. No outline (steam, not an object) and never i/m grey, so
# it can't be read as a rock or a pebble. Plays once; the renderer drifts it
# up 1 px per frame and removes it after the last frame.
sprite = dampf
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
anim   = puff frames=3 ticks=8
---
